  "nativeAffiliateRead": "Separate versioned browser consent on the SAME original connection; original scopes/health/source receipts preserved.",
  "privateBinding": "Server custody per real holder. Manual key binding is an existing fallback, not the requested user-onboarding flow. Internal original issuer remains inactive and outside this package.",
